# rule|file|matches allowed|reason
# Used by scripts/style-check/style-check.ts. Keep the count exact: the check fails when it is too low as well.

# A Drop that runs while a panic unwinds must not panic: a second panic aborts the process.
poison|crates/habilis-network/src/transport/pool.rs|2|InFlightDial::drop clears the in-flight entry during unwinding. register_dial must read the same map.
# The guard of a test must survive a test that panicked, or it hides the failure that matters.
poison|crates/habilis-network-test-tracing/src/lib.rs|2|lock helper of the test guard: the import and the call.

# The light-cycles example uses native generators, a nightly-only feature.
feature|crates/habilis-network-netplay/examples/light-cycles/native/game/src/lib.rs|1|coroutines, yield_expr (nightly example)
feature|crates/habilis-network-netplay/examples/light-cycles/native/visage-rust-tui/src/lib.rs|1|coroutines, coroutine_trait (nightly example)

# A panic must not cross the C boundary: this is the defence in depth that the guide allows.
catch_unwind|crates/habilis-network-ffi/src/ffi.rs|1|FFI boundary

# The one catch_unwind outside the FFI boundary: the helper that the tests use to check a panic.
catch_unwind|crates/habilis-network-test-tracing/src/lib.rs|1|catch_panic, the helper that the tests use to check a panic

# anyhow_pub: a public signature returns anyhow. Each library file is typed in a later commit of
# package 7, and its line goes with that commit.
anyhow_pub|crates/habilis-network-iroh-webrtc-transport/src/bench.rs|3|benchmark harness behind the bench feature, not library API
anyhow_pub|crates/habilis-network/src/blob/consume.rs|1|package 7: typed in a later commit
anyhow_pub|crates/habilis-network/src/blob/mod.rs|1|package 7: typed in a later commit
anyhow_pub|crates/habilis-network/src/blob/produce.rs|2|package 7: typed in a later commit
anyhow_pub|crates/habilis-network/src/blob/ticket.rs|1|package 7: typed in a later commit
anyhow_pub|crates/habilis-network/src/daemon/config.rs|1|package 7: typed in a later commit
anyhow_pub|crates/habilis-network/src/daemon/event_loop.rs|1|package 7: typed in a later commit
anyhow_pub|crates/habilis-network/src/daemon/node.rs|2|package 7: typed in a later commit
anyhow_pub|crates/habilis-network/src/daemon/params.rs|5|package 7: typed in a later commit
anyhow_pub|crates/habilis-network/src/daemon/setup.rs|3|package 7: typed in a later commit
anyhow_pub|crates/habilis-network/src/daemon/shutdown.rs|1|package 7: typed in a later commit
anyhow_pub|crates/habilis-network/src/daemon/state_file.rs|1|package 7: typed in a later commit
anyhow_pub|crates/habilis-network/src/gossip/broadcast.rs|2|package 7: typed in a later commit
anyhow_pub|crates/habilis-network/src/lookup/capability.rs|1|package 7: typed in a later commit
anyhow_pub|crates/habilis-network/src/lookup/mod.rs|4|3 public fns to type in batch 4, and the test relay helper spawn_plain behind iroh-test-utils (one row per file: the allow file is keyed by file, so it cannot be split)
anyhow_pub|crates/habilis-network/src/membership/app.rs|2|package 7: typed in a later commit
anyhow_pub|crates/habilis-network/src/membership/join.rs|3|package 7: typed in a later commit
